<!--Post: 653--><!--Time: 1091211430-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST653"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Muskogee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Muskogee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, July 30, 2004 - 11:17 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->George, I still think your raise a very important point.  Some no-good-doers target small women because they perceive that they are easy targets.  And some women see themselves as easy targets because they are small &#40;and these women might be less inclined to fight back&#41;. <BR> <BR>You are correct about my firefighting experience &#40;though I could only pin them- not throw them around, LOL...I think there&#39;d be some really bruised egos if any of them read that!&#41;.  I live in Texas now, but did my firefighting in Delaware, where I grew up.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 653-->
<!--Post: 655--><!--Time: 1091239197-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST655"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, July 30, 2004 - 6:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The &#34;Diamond State,&#34; I think.  <BR> <BR>The targeting done during the stalking phase. BTK knew how to fit in. At outdoor scenes, Zodiac had a skill for stalking; BTK had, possibly, even better skills when stalking neighborhoods. Neither Z nor BTK were seen by many witnesses.  <BR> <BR>One difference, I think, is that BTK probably wore <BR>uniforms, etc., as he indicated recently indicated. <BR>Only a guess but Zodiac, excepting the ritualistic LB attack, I think disguised himself a bit, but perhaps used clothes he didn&#39;t ordinarily wear or something along those lines. <BR> <BR>Why Vicky Wegerle? I don&#39;t know. Geographic profiling might answer the question.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 655-->
<!--Post: 939--><!--Time: 1093703802-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST939"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Christa<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Christa<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, August 28, 2004 - 7:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I went to church with Vicky.  I was young at the time so I do not remember much about the murder.  When the story broke on the news that btk was responsible my dad told me that everyone in the church thought that her husband was the one that had killed her.  He also began to tell me about what he knew of btk and also the zodiac because of the similarities and his dad also lived in California.  I began taking on an interest and learning about the two killers from Tom&#39;s websites. And I think the reason for the killing of Vicky may be a simple reason but very hard to figure out.  The zodiac, possibly Arthur Leigh Allen, killed on days that triigered something in him such as a holiday or a death in the family.  Something triggered btk that day to come out of hidding and kill Vicky.  But I still wonder if he was in hiding.  I think that he was killing the whole time we just don&#39;t know who.  But btk will let us know on the date that he chooses because every date has a meaning to him.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
