<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST945"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Christa<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Christa<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, August 28, 2004 - 5:09 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It also makes you wonder if btk stalked her for a while if he was at the church or maybe somehow involved with the church.  By the way it was St. Andrews Lutheran Church.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
