<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST949"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Christa<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Christa<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, August 29, 2004 - 9:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I totally agree teardrop.  He has been killing for the past twenty years and will continue to kill unless he is physically unable to do so.  He may of strayed from his normal style of killing but is still killing.  We will never know who or how many because the police are not using their community as a resource.  But btk will let us know when the time is right to him because he is playing the city of wichita<!--/Text--></td></tr>
