<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST951"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sapper<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sapper<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, August 29, 2004 - 3:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think you all have it here. I very much doubt that he ever quit killing. I think he will countinue to claim victims. But Iam not sure they will all be in Wichita. I think we need to figure out why he claimed Vicky and not some other.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
