<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1744"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Artimis<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Artimis<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 10, 2004 - 11:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->She was supposed to pick up her school-age child up at school for lunch that day, my God!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
