<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12174"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 2:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->J- I heard that too????????  So in addition to taking souveniers from his victims - he was a theif????  OMG - I think &#34;linked to the 10 victims he is charged with killing&#34;  are perhaps the key words here....It is frightening to think there are more. <BR>The a&#42;&#42;. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12174-->
<!--Post: 12952--><!--Time: 1113836432-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12952"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tulip<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tulip<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 18, 2005 - 8:00 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I was reading some old newspaper articles from Marine Hedge&#39;s murder.  She is the last known BTK victim prior to Wegerele.  Det. Van Wey was the lead investigator on this case.  He name appeared a lot in these articles.  Every time I saw his name, I thought &#34;Vicki Wegerle&#34;.  Maybe it&#39;s just me, though. <BR> <BR>Still, since Wegerle was murdered the same day as Capt. Al Stewarts retirement party, maybe DTDC was thumbing his nose at WPD -- killing someone with the initials VW, for Van Wey on the day of Stewarts retirement party. <BR> <BR>Just a guess.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12952-->
<!--Post: 12955--><!--Time: 1113841339-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12955"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, April 18, 2005 - 9:22 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tulip, that&#39;s not a bad guess!Didn&#39;t Det. Van Wey become the Park City Police Chief around that time?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12955-->
